@startuml product-autonomous-realization-boundary
title Product / Autonomous Product Realization Boundary ; per ADR-ES-017 §1 + §2 + §3

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Product" as P
class "Autonomous Product" as AP
class "Material Autonomous Progression" as MAP

P <|-- AP : specializes
AP *-- MAP : material-evidence

class "Independent Product Decisions" as IPD
class "Independent Action Selection" as IAS
class "Autonomous Configuration" as AC
class "Autonomous Coordination" as ACO
class "Autonomous Fulfillment Progression" as AFP
class "Contextual Adaptation" as CA
class "Autonomous Exception Handling" as AEH
class "Autonomous Progression toward Objectives" as APO

MAP --> IPD
MAP --> IAS
MAP --> AC
MAP --> ACO
MAP --> AFP
MAP --> CA
MAP --> AEH
MAP --> APO

note bottom of MAP
  Material autonomous progression requires substantive evidence
  in one or more of the listed dimensions per ADR-ES-017 §5.
end note

@enduml
